# Preview mode. ON unless this is set to exactly "false".
#
# When the question bank cannot fill the official 90-question quotas, the app
# serves the largest honest paper it can instead of refusing outright. Every
# question in a preview was still printed on a real paper with the answer that
# paper gave — there are simply not yet enough of them to be the examination.
#
# A preview is labelled as one on every question and on the results, states its
# real length and which topics are short, and is never marked against the
# official pass mark. None of that labelling depends on this flag.
#
# Set to "false" for the strict build, which refuses a short bank outright and
# reports the shortfall per topic. Anything else — unset, empty, misspelled —
# leaves preview mode on, so the app is never accidentally a dead end.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_PREVIEW_MODE=false
